# Go Testing

**Activation gate:** apply this rule only for an explicit current-task user-authorized `TEST_TASK`; otherwise do not create, edit, or run tests.

> This file extends the common testing rule with Go specific content.

## Framework

Use the standard `go test` with **table-driven tests**.

## Race Detection

Within an authorized Go testing task, use the `-race` flag only when the named
concurrency claim requires it; do not broaden automatically to every package:

```bash
go test -race ./...
```

## Coverage

```bash
go test -cover ./...
```

## Reference

See skill: `golang-testing` for detailed Go testing patterns and helpers.
